  "description": "Story/Gen3. The matrix's MIRROR COAT observation. A Wynaut's `mirror_coat` ability fires its stored-damage counter-hit, which the source pushes onto its detailed log as a real `type: \"attack\"` entry (bundle.deobfuscated.js:58108-58142) -- an event of the same ordered attack family `event.battle.turns` already compares. The port applied the damage but logged nothing, so nine rounds showed `event.battle.turns[i].events[len]` js=2 / py=1 with rounds, RNG draws, winner and every final HP agreeing exactly. This is M4 repair 7, and this route is where the cross-runtime search gate first rejected it: nine admin candidates were turned away on this path before the cause was traced.",
